  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uniS9UM.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"276\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" width=\"86\" height=\"23\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此模组将为您的游戏添加各种各样的新装饰性光源，从仙女灯到夜灯！<br><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a_4T-7BOqCY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"325\" height=\"325\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Josh/Joosh - 美术<br>samgj15 - 编程<br>flechazo098 - 编程<br><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物与野兽</a></strong>&nbsp;- 一款向《我的世界》中添加惊人生物的模组！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">小动物与伙伴</a></strong> - 一款添加了多种友好动物的模组！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ghost\" rel=\"nofollow\">幽灵</a></strong>&nbsp;- 为您的世界添加了两种友好的幽灵生物！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傀儡 overhaul</a></strong> - 一款添加了9种新型傀儡的模组！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lookin-sharp\" rel=\"nofollow\">锋利外观</a></strong>&nbsp;- 为游戏添加了60种新的近战武器！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">苦力怕 overhaul</a>&nbsp;</strong>- 一款对原版苦力怕进行全面革新的模组！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderman-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">末影人 overhaul</a></strong> - 一款对原版末影人进行全面革新的模组！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ribbits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>蛙鸣</strong></a>&nbsp;- 添加了充满被称为“小村民”的微型村民的沼泽村庄！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jjiWlso.png\" width=\"879\" height=\"273\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hu0Djdp.png\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcloudnord.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nLUVuvA.png\" width=\"844\" height=\"275\"></a></p>",
